# The cleanup runs when the body stops with an error too, which then
# goes on as it was. The body's type is free, since it never gives a
# value: the signal stands where any value may.
== SOURCE
'{ @ -> p_rint! 3; "x" []S_IGNAL "y" } []E_NSURE '{ @ -> p_rint! "cleaned" }
== TYPE
a
== ERROR
error[x]: y at 19..36
